    <string name="str_about_html"><![CDATA[<h2>Flash SPI Tool</h2><p>Advanced application for reading, verifying, and writing Firmware (SPI Flash Memories) with native <b>flashrom</b>.</p><hr/><b>Project License:</b> GPLv3.<br/><br/><b>Dependencies and Libraries:</b><br/>• <a href="https://github.com/mik3y/usb-serial-for-android">usb-serial-for-android</a> (MIT)<br/>• <a href="https://github.com/libusb/libusb">libusb</a> (LGPL-2.1+)<br/>• <a href="https://github.com/pciutils/pciutils">pciutils</a> (GPL-2.0+)<br/>• <a href="https://developer.intra2net.com/git/libftdi">libftdi</a> (LGPL-2.1+)<br/>• <a href="https://gitlab.zapb.de/libjaylink/libjaylink">libjaylink</a> (GPL-2.0+)<br/>• <a href="https://github.com/flashrom/flashrom">flashrom</a> (GPL-2.0)<br/><br/><b>Developer Related Projects:</b><br/>• <a href="https://github.com/Danielk10/PIC-k150-Programing">PIC k150 Programming</a> — PIC programmer via Android with P018A protocol<br/>]]></string>
